{"data": [{"author_id": "1497541723089944578", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:07:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116894999665099088"], "id": "2116894999665099088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "自2016年习近平搞独裁开始，中国出生人口7年内减半，而日本花了40年，韩国花了20年。中国如今的出生人口，还包括了脑子里还比较封建的八零后九零后，等00后开始不把传宗接代当回事后，出生人口再次雪崩的可能还在加大，出生人口会远远少于中国抗日时期的最低水平，这样的未来中国怎么可能发展好", "url": "https://x.com/Bob32504385/status/2116894999665099088"}, {"author_id": "1505058790160609282", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:49:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116709216782336172"], "id": "2116709216782336172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小学老师转岗教中学，上了热搜。原因不在教育，在出生人口：2016年出生1786万，2024年954万，八年少一半。\n小学在校生2024年已经见顶，之后往下走。老师多出来了，编制不能裁，只能往上挪。初中大概2030年轮到。\n所以“教师是铁饭碗”要改一句：饭碗跟出生人口绑定，人口才是老板。", "url": "https://x.com/waz3923/status/2116709216782336172"}, {"author_id": "1585964743155589141", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116687176079675586"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qCrulZVzIe", "end": 48, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Fc2024K/status/2116687176079675586/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116687158153297920", "start": 25, "url": "https://t.co/qCrulZVzIe"}]}, "id": "2116687176079675586", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1850年到2025年美国人口中外国出生人口比例 https://t.co/qCrulZVzIe", "url": "https://x.com/Fc2024K/status/2116687176079675586"}, {"author_id": "1892261573328277504", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:22:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116445688699699318"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/X8A1YkUrRc", "end": 58, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116445665727504384", "start": 35, "url": "https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/X8A1YkUrRc", "end": 58, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116445666671304704", "start": 35, "url": "https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc"}]}, "id": "2116445688699699318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc", "url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318"}, {"author_id": "1683661862603456513", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:49:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116376938453561545", "2116377183510000024"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/moeKafuuChino/…", "end": 87, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/moeKafuuChino/status/2116367135345926611", "start": 64, "url": "https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH"}]}, "id": "2116376938453561545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116367135345926611", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "按出生人口推算的话 高校毕业生人数每年都会增加喵.....\n\n2016-2017高点出生的人\n2038-2039本科毕业喵.. https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH", "url": "https://x.com/shenxianovo/status/2116376938453561545"}, {"author_id": "1754072461212344320", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116473000983724479"], "id": "2116473000983724479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 234, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国出生人口一路在掉，广东一个省，还稳稳站在 100 万以上\n\n遥遥领先第二名\n\n谁知道，这是为什么？", "url": "https://x.com/Qian888jin/status/2116473000983724479"}, {"author_id": "2070722035781910528", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:11:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116533530377572641"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 49, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 44, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2116533530377572641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 502, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年万圣节今天做爱的有多少人没带套？请你根据出生人口怀孕率，反推出多少人没带套？ @grok 仅需中国即可", "url": "https://x.com/Nnnxq3j/status/2116533530377572641"}, {"author_id": "18800657", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:29:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116432325001285682"], "id": "2116432325001285682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 441, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国每出生8个孩子，\n大约就有1个出生在广东。\n\n2025年，广东出生人口100.3万，\n连续多年位居全国第一。\n\n广东还是有钱，\n现在有钱人才愿意生孩子。", "url": "https://x.com/chaoxiao/status/2116432325001285682"}, {"author_id": "1683661862603456513", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:50:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116376938453561545", "2116377183510000024"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/moeKafuuChino/…", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/moeKafuuChino/status/2116367135345926611", "start": 93, "url": "https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH"}]}, "id": "2116377183510000024", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 424, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116367135345926611", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "按出生人口推算的话 高校毕业生人数每年都会增加喵.....\n\n2016-2017高点出生的人\n2038-2039本科毕业喵..\n\n就算92学历并且大学能刷两段实习的...也比较艰难喵😭 https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH", "url": "https://x.com/shenxianovo/status/2116377183510000024"}, {"author_id": "879361093142929408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:09:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116850214904721438"], "id": "2116850214904721438", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国全年出生人口：792万人，出生率5.63‰。全年死亡人口：1131万人，死亡率8.04‰自然增长率：-2.41‰（连续第四年负增长）广东是人口出生第一大省。人口减少真不是坏事。", "url": "https://x.com/Tommy94880575/status/2116850214904721438"}, {"author_id": "1701105621838483456", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116784805362982934"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 93, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 88, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2116784805362982934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "社保会不会崩盘，我不知道。\n\n但有一件事很确定：\n\n出生人口下降、老龄人口增加、年轻人晚就业，\n\n最后压力不会凭空消失，只会换一种方式落到某一代人身上。\n\n你觉得会落到哪一代？@grok", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoWanxing/status/2116784805362982934"}, {"author_id": "1116665952", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:43:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116994514137276448"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sweetie_rt/sta…", "end": 172, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sweetie_rt/status/2116750988157874572", "start": 149, "url": "https://t.co/mx337P2CA6"}]}, "id": "2116994514137276448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116750988157874572", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "你继续洗吧，按中国人口年鉴，1959-1961总出生人口4233万，到1961人口总数少了1348万，这三年死亡人数是4233+1348=5581万，如果按1956-1958三年平均死亡率来算，1959-1961正常死亡应该只有2000多万，非正常多死了多少人你算不清吗？还是非得秀一下你的智障？ https://t.co/mx337P2CA6", "url": "https://x.com/lihuan888888/status/2116994514137276448"}, {"author_id": "1984623209707384832", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:05:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116486834561945970"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3AZaGJuFep", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/8964TianAnMens/status/2116486834561945970/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116486826215211008", "start": 120, "url": "https://t.co/3AZaGJuFep"}]}, "id": "2116486834561945970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1106, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "中共：全世界还没有任何一个国家有养老金崩盘的先例，那我们就崩一个给你们看看，这不就有先例了\n\n话说回来，中共在世界上创造的先例还少吗？六年出生人口减半，房地产五年腰斩等等人类奇迹，简直多得不胜枚举，再多崩一个养老金有什么可奇怪的？顺手的事 https://t.co/3AZaGJuFep", "url": "https://x.com/8964TianAnMens/status/2116486834561945970"}, {"author_id": "1116665952", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:08:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116895187473690889"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ty37w6pGpZ", "end": 205, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lihuan888888/status/2116895187473690889/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116892800143015937", "start": 182, "url": "https://t.co/ty37w6pGpZ"}]}, "id": "2116895187473690889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 363, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "计算三年多死亡人口，1959出生1665万，1960年出生1381万，1961年出生1187万，三年出生人口4233万，而到1961年人口比1959年减少1348万，也就是这三年死亡总人数为4233万加1348万，总共 死亡5581万，在1956到1958平均死亡率是1.14%，按前三年平均死亡率，1959-1961正常死亡应该是1992万左右，多死3589万 https://t.co/ty37w6pGpZ", "url": "https://x.com/lihuan888888/status/2116895187473690889"}, {"author_id": "135732488", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:20:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116581193294794844"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/KELMAND1/statu…", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/KELMAND1/status/2115992358169022830", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/PvZ5CVJ0FS"}]}, "id": "2116581193294794844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115992358169022830", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "那个1983年的年鉴本来就是特定背景下出来的（为否定路线，降低改革阻力）\n因为根据2000年五普数据，1960年出生且活到了40岁的人口还有 1468万人，比1983年的年鉴上的当年出生人口多几百万。\n年鉴上的出生率被证实是不准的，那么它记录的死亡率你相信是准的吗？\n那其它所有基于这个年鉴的研究结果？呵呵 https://t.co/PvZ5CVJ0FS", "url": "https://x.com/iviso/status/2116581193294794844"}, {"author_id": "135732488", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:38:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116857383192506797"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sweetie_rt/sta…", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sweetie_rt/status/2116771417639494087", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/7unsg9z5SI"}]}, "id": "2116857383192506797", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116771417639494087", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "最基础的数据是基于《中国统计年鉴1983》吧。\n但那是个80年代特殊背景下的仓促产物。里面记载的1960年出生的人，甚至比2000人口普查还活着的40岁人少100多万，这还不算中途那些病逝或其它原因死亡的。\n出生人口都不准的，死亡人口就必准？\n这就好比基于一错误定理，用它推出的答案全是垃圾进、垃圾出。 https://t.co/7unsg9z5SI", "url": "https://x.com/iviso/status/2116857383192506797"}, {"author_id": "1501748415461740547", "created_at": "2026-11-01T03:48:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116739224951259381"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 149, "start": 145, "tag": "浇朋友"}, {"end": 155, "start": 150, "tag": "蓝V互关"}]}, "id": "2116739224951259381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 298, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "发现一个离谱的现象！💀\n\n全国年轻人都在喊不婚不育\n\n广东却连续8年拿下出生人口第一\n\n结婚登记量也连续4年全国第一！\n\n2025年，广东出生了100多万人，结婚登记超过61万对！\n\n不是说现在年轻人都不想结婚生娃了吗？\n\n广东人到底掌握了什么生存秘籍？！ 🤣\n\n广东的朋友出来解释一下！\n#浇朋友 #蓝V互关", "url": "https://x.com/xingyu_ling/status/2116739224951259381"}, {"author_id": "1952604865856991234", "created_at": "2026-11-01T03:45:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116738290707726539"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lihua985432/st…", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lihua985432/status/2116668943033405768", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/eQN2YQ7RWm"}]}, "id": "2116738290707726539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1242, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116668943033405768", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1960年人口净增长是根据82人口普查里1960年出生人口存活率大于1推算出来的，chenqin就别提了，他写了六篇文章抨击孙经先和杨松林合著的那本“总要有人说出真相”，一开始还能正常推算数据，越往后就越魔怔了，毫无数据分析纯粹挖史料佐证，对官方的一切数字都不信。 https://t.co/eQN2YQ7RWm", "url": "https://x.com/fei22081/status/2116738290707726539"}, {"author_id": "2057322349528064000", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116921959141478622"], "id": "2116921959141478622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1592, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大胆预测，明年民生领域会迎来八降！\n\n第一，房贷利率，楼市去库存，银行抢优质客户，利率还有小幅下行空间，月供压力有望减轻。\n第二，幼儿园费用，出生人口减少，很多民办园招不满，叠加普惠政策，保教费存在下调压力。\n第三，通信资费，运营商内卷，携号转网便利，低价套餐会越来越多。", "url": "https://x.com/OwenJzhlYzll/status/2116921959141478622"}, {"author_id": "2111628631885926400", "created_at": "2026-11-01T05:58:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116771913490104478"], "id": "2116771913490104478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一年出生792万人，年轻人为何越来越不愿结婚生子？\n\n每逢过年，很多年轻人最怕的不是走亲戚，而是长辈反复追问：“什么时候结婚？什么时候生孩子？”\n\n在老一辈眼里，结婚生子是人生必经之路。可如今，越来越多年轻人面对这些问题，却显得十分淡定，甚至把“不婚不育”当成一种生活选择。", "url": "https://x.com/Fffwrpl/status/2116771913490104478"}, {"article": {"title": "🔥【注意】中国来到新拐点！两大支出恐飙升‼️ "}, "author_id": "3341502893", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:57:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116545078063714619"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2116…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116544990457307137", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116544990457307137", "url": "https://t.co/ZKrgFWZnPw"}]}, "id": "2116545078063714619", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4229, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/ZKrgFWZnPw", "url": "https://x.com/zhihui999/status/2116545078063714619"}, {"author_id": "2108256097090035712", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:03:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116274810116624649"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/alexduncantx/s…", "end": 288, "